'''Speak of the Devil''' (鬼と呼ばれて, ''Oni to Yobarete'', '''Called an Oni''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Accounting Power Up (M): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 20%.

'''Pre 4.7''': Accounting Power Up (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

